   {"text": "You need a steel pickaxe first.",
    "clips": [{"id": "e2c9c151527f", "at": 2.5}],
    "pops": [{"word": "steel", "text": "STEEL PICKAXE", "color": "&H00E0A020&", "sfx": "aw-hell-nah-man_168e.mp3", "sfx_dur": 2.0, "v": 0.5, "react": "bald-shocked.gif"}]},
   {"text": "So smelt your ore in the furnace,",
    "clips": [{"id": "1c8c3e05998b", "at": 2.0}],
    "pops": [{"word": "smelt", "text": "SMELT", "color": "&H000080FF&", "sfx": "gen:tick", "v": 0.6},
             {"word": "furnace", "sfx": "gen:impact", "v": 0.6}]},
   {"text": "craft the steel pickaxe at the workbench,",
    "clips": [{"id": "23b83f65dcd0", "at": 1.5}],
    "pops": [{"word": "craft", "text": "CRAFTED!", "color": "&H0050C030&", "sfx": "gen:ding", "v": 0.6},
             {"word": "workbench", "sfx": "Minecraft_Fall_Damage__Crack__-_Sound_Effect__HD___320_kbps__7400.mp3", "sfx_from": 0.3, "sfx_dur": 0.7, "v": 0.5}]},
   {"text": "and now the gold is yours.",
    "clips": [{"id": "58c1e6108435", "at": 4.0}, {"id": "ba21b240afc0", "at": 2.0, "word": "yours"}],
    "pops": [{"word": "gold", "text": "+GOLD", "color": "&H0000D4FF&", "textcolor": "&H00000000&", "sfx": "Kids_Cheering_-_Gaming_Sound_Effect__HD___320_kbps__2cfe.mp3", "sfx_dur": 2.6, "v": 0.45, "react": "money.gif", "react_dur": 1.3}]},
   {"text": "Go deeper and smash glowing crystals for huge XP.",
    "clips": [{"id": "7f08bc34b0f4", "at": 2.0}, {"id": "2c75f88f951d", "at": 2.0, "word": "smash"}, {"id": "0f38710b6528", "at": 1.0, "word": "huge"}],
    "pops": [{"word": "deeper", "text": "DEEPER", "color": "&H00E0A020&", "sfx": "gen:whoosh", "v": 0.5},
             {"word": "smash", "text": "SMASH!", "sfx": "Minecraft_Fall_Damage__Crack__-_Sound_Effect__HD___320_kbps__7400.mp3", "sfx_from": 0.3, "sfx_dur": 0.7, "v": 0.6, "flash": true},
             {"word": "XP", "text": "+BIG XP", "color": "&H0000D4FF&", "textcolor": "&H00000000&", "sfx": "eagle-rahhh_9744.mp3", "sfx_dur": 2.4, "v": 0.5, "react": "theater.gif"}]},
   {"text": "You even earn coins and badges just for mining.",
